@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>AscendID API - Blazor UI</h1>

<p>Welcome to the AscendID API Blazor UI demonstration.</p>

<div class="alert alert-info">
    <h4>About This Application</h4>
    <p>
        This Blazor Server application demonstrates two approaches to consuming your API:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Blazor Server Mode:</strong> Direct access to Application layer via MediatR</li>
        <li><strong>API Mode:</strong> HTTP calls to the WebAPI endpoints</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        The application also demonstrates sharing FluentValidation validators between
        the API and UI for consistent validation rules.
    </p>
</div>

<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
    <li>View all Temp Test Records</li>
    <li>Create new records with validation</li>
    <li>Update existing records</li>
    <li>Delete records</li>
    <li>Shared FluentValidation between API and UI</li>
</ul>

<div class="mt-4">
    <a href="/temp-test-records" class="btn btn-primary">View Records</a>
    <a href="/create-record" class="btn btn-success ms-2">Create New Record</a>
</div>
